/*
  TimeMachineBanner.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 shared surface · 0143 · TimeMachineBanner (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. The banner keys mirror the web source
  (components/feedback/TimeMachineBanner.tsx) verbatim — timeMachine.banner.title / .body /
  .pickPrompt / .pick / .returnToLive / .submit / .cancel / .inputLabel — with the title template
  carrying the {when} token the native title builder substitutes (web i18next {{when}}). The native
  P4 leaf chrome (empty / loading / error / freshness) rounds out the surface so the Swift sources
  hold no English literals. These entries fold into the app Localizable.xcstrings master catalog at
  integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table ("TimeMachineBanner") so each parallel
  surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.
*/

